  "body": "Currently we set the skip-service-worker flag so a new location of a redirect does not get intercepted by a same-origin service worker. However, a cross-origin service worker should likely intercept that, otherwise we make service migration harder.\n\nSee https://github.com/slightlyoff/ServiceWorker/issues/793 for context.\n\n@mkruisselbrink will fix this (and will soon be able to assign himself).\n",
